(text "U1 represents the plug-in module, not a soldered module footprint.\nSocket contacts for module pins 1, 5, 6 and 16 are isolated.\nTX_EN/RX_EN slot contacts unused. No external RF switch added.\nJ3/J4: 15.24 mm row spacing; top/bottom numbering in FOOTPRINT_REVIEW.md." (at 140 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4163ef43-000f-5932-be95-ad9fa4080cff"))
