(text "KEYED SLOT: H1 engages the carrier M3 x 25 post before electrical contact.\nAll headers and passives factory fitted. No user soldering or antenna-selector rework.\nPower declarations describe power arriving through the slot and buck output after L1.\nNo PCB layout is authorized. Footprint and assembly evidence: see DESIGN_REVIEW.md." (at 20.32 267 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "488f325a-b92f-5fa5-9b80-e79348c7b57e"))
